#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:11
#: b26a7e004fe9482ea66fa61aeb392b98
msgid "ArduPilot no longer supports Arduino or AVR."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不再支持 Arduino 或 AVR。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:13
#: 05a3249f3dd8467dbb11152adffcc183
msgid ""
"This article explains how to build the code for APM2.x with Make on Windows,"
" Mac and Linux."
msgstr "本文介绍如何在 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 上使用 Make 为 APM2.x 构建代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:18
#: b67384a0025d40aa98bc7cb6f74b661e
msgid ""
"Copter 3.3 firmware (and later) and builds after Plane 3.4.0 no longer fit "
"on APM boards. Plane, Rover and AntennaTracker builds can still be installed"
" at time of writing but you can no longer build APM2.x off the master branch"
" (you will need to build off a supported release branch)."
msgstr ""
"Copter 3.3 及更高版本固件，以及 Plane 3.4.0 之后的构建版本，已无法安装到 APM 飞控板。在撰写本文时，Plane、Rover "
"和 AntennaTracker 的构建仍可安装，但无法再从 master 分支构建 APM2.x（需要从受支持的发行分支构建）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:24
#: 337d4f5975a14987b1fe5f994421eee4
msgid ""
"The last Copter firmware that can be built on APM 2.x `can be downloaded "
"from here "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"可在 APM 2.x 上构建的最后一个 Copter 固件版本可从 `此处下载 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:27
#: 2df3315215bb44a7a9a6327c185bc0e7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:29
#: 2a84c5e1847a40208be0bd2482f024c7
msgid ""
"The preferred way for developers to build APM applications is using the "
"Makefile system distributed with the repository. This Makefile system is the"
" canonical way to build APM. APM applications can no longer be built with "
"the standard Arduino IDE, as the APM build requires the Arduino IDE base "
"libraries to be excluded from the build."
msgstr ""
"开发者构建 APM 应用程序的首选方式是使用仓库中附带的 Makefile 系统。该 Makefile 系统是构建 APM 的标准方式。APM "
"应用程序无法再使用标准 Arduino IDE 构建，因为 APM 构建要求将 Arduino IDE 基础库排除在外。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:35
#: d11da07704324ddf80f949bdf7a973e7
msgid ""
"For developers who would prefer not to use make, a modified Arduino IDE "
"which emulates the custom APM build process is available."
msgstr "对于不希望使用 make 的开发者，有一个修改版的 Arduino IDE 可模拟自定义 APM 构建过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:39
#: b75277b9950740b3baddc7fee54c5dbc
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:41
#: 8f6628aaf8b14759a715279bfc7550f1
msgid ""
"The APM makefiles will work out of the box for Mac OS and Linux users. "
"Windows users can use the makefiles via a Unix compatibility system such as "
"Mingw or Cygwin."
msgstr ""
"APM Makefile 在 Mac OS 和 Linux 上可开箱即用。Windows 用户可以通过 Mingw 或 Cygwin 等 Unix "
"兼容系统使用 Makefile。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:46
#: a311c65b6af94741b2328cb62b1d8ce3
msgid "Mac OS"
msgstr "Mac OS"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:48
#: bd27828695ed4c03ba4b352910ce9380
msgid "Mac OS system requirements are:"
msgstr "Mac OS 系统要求如下："

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:50
#: 4316dfc30f7a4f0ebfe27bb1e1eb0fe7
msgid ""
"An Arduino install of version 1.0 or greater. The Arduino installation "
"provides an AVR compiler."
msgstr "版本 1.0 或更高的 Arduino 安装。Arduino 安装程序提供了 AVR 编译器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:52
#: 67e100315ddc4ad2b2ea05de97a34af2
msgid ""
"Apple Developer Tools (a free download from Apple). These provide command "
"line utilities including GNU Make."
msgstr "Apple 开发者工具（可从 Apple 免费下载）。这些工具提供命令行实用程序，包括 GNU Make。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:55
#: e6502018cc0f4366a6da6fed3fe63b8c
msgid ""
"Arduino should be installed in a location that is indexed by Spotlight."
msgstr "Arduino 应安装在 Spotlight 可以索引的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:58
#: 7cbf73b4053c4c39bd201e1e72bf02dd
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:60
#: 6cf92053202746279be90afcfe7c84d6
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions on :ref:`this page <building-the-code-onlinux>` to "
"build the code with Linux. Linux system requirements vary depending on the "
"distribution. The following are essential:"
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`此页面 <building-the-code-onlinux>` 上的说明在 Linux 上构建代码。Linux "
"系统要求因发行版而异，以下是基本要求："

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:64
#: b9c335ba9e5f4aeda230dfe3a3f19dc9
msgid "The GNU sed utility."
msgstr "GNU sed 工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:65
#: 9f50e4aa148a49f2bcbfec832008f1c1
msgid "The GNU make utility, sometimes referred to as 'gmake'."
msgstr "GNU make 工具，有时也称为「gmake」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:66
#: dec2a3f795b041909d9e146833ab5ba2
msgid ""
"The GNU awk utility, often referred to as 'gawk'. **Warning:** Many Linux "
"distributions do not come with 'gawk' by default. You can test for the "
"presence of this tool with the 'which gawk' command."
msgstr ""
"GNU awk 工具，通常称为「gawk」。**警告：** 许多 Linux 发行版默认不带「gawk」。可以用「which "
"gawk」命令检测是否安装了此工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:69
#: cec9f3547887473d94be5d846d036113
msgid "The AVR-GCC toolchain."
msgstr "AVR-GCC 工具链。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:71
#: 9727bcdbe7ff4a729a9541938437162b
msgid ""
"There are various ways to get all of these utilities for your system. You "
"may consult `Arduino's Linux guide "
"<http://playground.arduino.cc/learning/linux>`__ for instructions on "
"installing the AVR toolchain under Linux."
msgstr ""
"获取这些工具的方式有多种。可参考 `Arduino 的 Linux 指南 "
"<http://playground.arduino.cc/learning/linux>`__ 中在 Linux 下安装 AVR 工具链的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:76
#: 689822d5658646acb87bf8d8235368da
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:78
#: 8b55d7e0b1c4487ba8fb24bddb292b8c
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions on :ref:`Building ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows "
"with Make <building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make>`. These "
"instructions make use of the *PX4 Toolchain*'s development environment."
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`在 Windows 上使用 Make 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot <building-ardupilot-for-"
"apm2-x-on-windows-with-make>` 中的说明操作。这些说明使用了 *PX4 Toolchain* 的开发环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:82
#: 97882582d5674fe39dca2bda568ec7e8
msgid "Preparing"
msgstr "准备工作"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:84
#: 97759d13adbf4ee09e5858acf67b79da
msgid ""
"Locally clone the APM repository from https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot"
msgstr "从 https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot 在本地克隆 APM 仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:93
#: 03d46d9d8c4349e89956dd38cd6814ee
msgid "Building"
msgstr "构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:95
#: ddd759b2d06747c8bd7fef8985d23cc5
msgid ""
"To build a sketch for the default hardware platform you specified in "
"**config.mk**, you can invoke \\ *make* with no arguments in a sketch "
"directory:"
msgstr "要为 **config.mk** 中指定的默认硬件平台构建 sketch，可在 sketch 目录中不带任何参数调用 *make*："

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:104
#: 8fbf90bfd42b4d87a7a0f73f921b3b5f
msgid ""
"The output of the build is, by default, located in "
"**$TMPDIR/_sketchname_.build**"
msgstr "构建输出默认位于 **$TMPDIR/_sketchname_.build**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:119
#: 77a58656c1a54df496cb961f9bfc6a5e
msgid "Uploading"
msgstr "上传"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:121
#: 08b4a070e830432384c87a5d17e9192a
msgid ""
"If you have configured the \\`PORT\\` variable properly, the \\`upload\\` "
"target will use \\`avrdude\\` to upload a built APM application to AVR based"
" platforms."
msgstr ""
"如果正确配置了 \\`PORT\\` 变量，\\`upload\\` 目标将使用 \\`avrdude\\` 将已构建的 APM 应用程序上传到基于 "
"AVR 的平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:130
#: f1e38bd44f4946eca023021ae1addeef
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk platforms, the \\`px4-upload\\` target will use the PX4 "
"bootloader to perform an upload."
msgstr "对于 Pixhawk 平台，\\`px4-upload\\` 目标将使用 PX4 引导加载程序进行上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:134
#: 436d0894333043db9f27ff79def527a7
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:136
#: e0e42627ffaf41658094881a1b4b73f7
msgid ""
"The build process itself attempts to diagnose problems that would prevent a "
"successful build outside of code errors. It may emit the following "
"diagnostics:"
msgstr "构建过程本身会尝试诊断代码错误之外可能阻止成功构建的问题，可能会输出以下诊断信息："

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:140
#: 501e89a35c25408aa58696713227c5f2
msgid ""
"**WARNING: More than one copy of Arduino was found, using ...(Mac OS only)**"
msgstr ""
"**WARNING: More than one copy of Arduino was found, using ...（仅 Mac OS）**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:143
#: 1806603e3331454596dee7921d893f6c
msgid ""
"Spotlight found more than one copy of Arduino installed on your system. "
"Check the path that is printed to ensure that the correct version is being "
"used. To avoid this problem, either remove old versions of Arduino or "
"specify the ARDUINO option when invoking the build system. Typically the "
"installation that will be chosen is the one that was most recently launched."
msgstr ""
"Spotlight 在您的系统上找到了多个 Arduino 副本。请检查打印出的路径，确保使用了正确的版本。要避免此问题，可删除旧版 "
"Arduino，或在调用构建系统时通过 ARDUINO 选项指定版本。通常选用的是最近一次启动的那个安装版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:150
#: ad35a5083c7b4eb689cfb8159ceda1f8
msgid "**ERROR: must set BOARD before including this file.**"
msgstr "**ERROR: must set BOARD before including this file.**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:152
#: 8a90a0b67d5843da8f01476ac18eca65
msgid ""
"The sketch Makefile has not defined the BOARD variable. This is normally set"
" to \\`atmega2560\\` for APM2.x builds."
msgstr "sketch 的 Makefile 未定义 BOARD 变量。对于 APM2.x 构建，该变量通常设为 \\`atmega2560\\`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:155
#: 1ce50d23144c41d083ece6df87ab5332
msgid "**ERROR: Spotlight cannot find Arduino on your system.(Mac OS only)**"
msgstr "**ERROR: Spotlight cannot find Arduino on your system.（仅 Mac OS）**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:157
#: c4c2e683350249e7af9153bc3b53506b
msgid ""
"Arduino is not installed, or it is installed in a location that is not being"
" indexed by Spotlight. You can either enable Spotlight for the location "
"where Arduino is installed, or specify the location explicitly by setting "
"the ARDUINO option as described above. Note that Spotlight indexing may take"
" some time, so enabling it for the location containing Arduino may not "
"immediately correct this issue."
msgstr ""
"Arduino 未安装，或安装在 Spotlight 未索引的位置。可以为 Arduino 安装位置启用 Spotlight，或通过如上所述的 "
"ARDUINO 选项明确指定位置。请注意，Spotlight 索引可能需要一些时间，因此为 Arduino 所在位置启用索引后，可能不会立即解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:164
#: b1daba24625e47cd95029116098948e2
msgid "**ERROR: Cannot find Arduino on this system**"
msgstr "**ERROR: Cannot find Arduino on this system**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:166
#: 3a783fb94c794c4fb2c4197a4f65f800
msgid ""
"(Linux and Windows only)Arduino was not found in one of the standard "
"locations. Either move Arduino to a standard location, or specify its "
"current location with the ARDUINO option in the **config.mk** file"
msgstr ""
"（仅 Linux 和 Windows）在标准位置未找到 Arduino。可以将 Arduino 移至标准位置，或在 **config.mk** "
"文件中通过 ARDUINO 选项指定当前位置"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:170
#: b817f707cc59496d83d3f034109c45f2
msgid "**ERROR: cannot find the compiler tools anywhere on the path ...**"
msgstr "**ERROR: cannot find the compiler tools anywhere on the path ...**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:172
#: 632d6458ec8540f09315656be0c02a8b
msgid ""
"The compiler and related tools cannot be found. For Mac OS and Windows the "
"tools are normally part of Arduino and this message indicates that the "
"Arduino installation is damaged."
msgstr ""
"找不到编译器及相关工具。对于 Mac OS 和 Windows，这些工具通常是 Arduino 的一部分，此消息表明 Arduino 安装已损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:176
#: 7b055ea3d46a4add9777d428bc431507
msgid ""
"For Linux systems, this means that the AVR tools are not installed in a "
"standard location. Either set the TOOLPATH option to point to the directory "
"containing the AVR tools, or install them in a standard location. Normally "
"installing Arduino on a Linux system will result in a correct installation "
"of the AVR tools."
msgstr ""
"对于 Linux 系统，这意味着 AVR 工具未安装在标准位置。可将 TOOLPATH 选项设置为指向包含 AVR "
"工具的目录，或将其安装在标准位置。通常在 Linux 系统上安装 Arduino 后，AVR 工具也会被正确安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:182
#: 013ae7e18db542409e5587d53bfc6a25
msgid "**ERROR: cannot find gawk - you may need to install GNU awk**"
msgstr "**ERROR: cannot find gawk - you may need to install GNU awk**"

#: ../../source/docs/building_with_make.rst:184
#: bae5ba02017846cfbfbf71175b39d69f
msgid ""
"(Linux and Windows only)The GNU awk utility is required, but it has not been"
" installed or cannot be found. Check that \\`gawk --version\\` works at the "
"command promp. You may need to specify its location explicitly with the AWK "
"option."
msgstr ""
"（仅 Linux 和 Windows）需要 GNU awk 工具，但未安装或无法找到。请确认 \\`gawk --version\\` "
"在命令提示符下可以正常运行。您可能需要通过 AWK 选项明确指定其位置。"
